---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base pageTitle="方法与口径 · AgentNews">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">AgentNews</a><span>/</span><span>方法与口径</span></div>
    <h1>方法与口径</h1>
    <p class="muted">我们公开算法与数据来源 —— 综合分是观点，不是客观事实；所有原始指标都可切换排序。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid" style="margin-top:0">
    <div class="box">
      <div class="box-header">综合分</div>
      <div class="box-body muted">
        <ol style="padding-left:20px">
          <li>每个指标 log 压缩（抑制数量级差距）</li>
          <li>同形态组内分位数归一 ∈ [0,1]</li>
          <li>缺失指标权重重分配给其余指标</li>
          <li>加权求和 → [0,100]</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <div class="box-header">权重（v1）</div>
      <div class="box-body muted">
        <div class="spread"><span>Star 总量</span><span class="mono">20%</span></div>
        <div class="spread"><span>30 日增速</span><span class="mono">25%</span></div>
        <div class="spread"><span>活跃度</span><span class="mono">15%</span></div>
        <div class="spread"><span>安装量</span><span class="mono">20%</span></div>
        <div class="spread"><span>贡献者</span><span class="mono">10%</span></div>
        <div class="spread"><span>生态</span><span class="mono">5%</span></div>
        <div class="spread"><span>Fork</span><span class="mono">5%</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <div class="box-header">开源/闭源判定</div>
      <div class="box-body muted">
        按 License 与源码可见性，不按分发渠道。Claude Code 走 npm 但闭源；Aider 走 PyPI 但开源。
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <div class="box-header">数据来源</div>
      <div class="box-body muted">
        GitHub API · npm registry · PyPI (pypistats) · VS Code Marketplace（低频）。每日 UTC 02:00 采集，快照归档。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-title"><h2>反作弊</h2></div>
    <div class="box">
      <div class="box-body muted">
        <ul style="padding-left:20px">
          <li>单日 star 增幅 &gt; 5% 且无 release/报道佐证 → 打 suspicious，趋势榜剔除</li>
          <li>增速基准低于 FLOOR（7d=50，30d=200）→ 不参与增速榜（防小基数暴涨）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-title"><h2>免责</h2></div>
    <div class="box">
      <div class="box-body muted">榜单为独立整理，与任何厂商无利益关联。数据可能有延迟或错误，欢迎提交 Issue 纠错。</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
